        "product_summary": "Leather and mesh upper: Woven mesh across the vamp and side panels is framed by stitched leather overlays, creating a distinct casual sneaker profile.\n\nVisible stitched sole edge: A continuous seam above the contrasting sole adds a clear construction detail for casual footwear collections.\n\nLace-up low-top design: Traditional laces adjust across the instep, while the low collar works with everyday trousers and relaxed outfits.\n\nPVC outsole: The photographed outsole has a repeating waved tread pattern and a layered sidewall profile.\n\nTwo neutral options: Sand and Khaki, with EU39-45 options. Send quantities by colour and EU size, packing preference and destination for a wholesale quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
